,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2029495290,"text":"あ、そうだ…君にはまだ状況を説明していなかったな…","nextNodeIds":[716620210]},{"nodeId":716620210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":8763626,"text":"事の経緯はこうだ。少し前、協会の冒険者小隊が野外で奇妙な扉を発見した…今俺の隣にあるこの扉だ。","nextNodeIds":[716620211]},{"nodeId":716620211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3747168282,"text":"冒険者小隊は扉をくぐり抜けると、なんと未知の秘境に到着したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620212]},{"nodeId":716620212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2518411378,"text":"最初に入った冒険者たちによると、そこは「空っぽの家」のような状態だったらしい。","nextNodeIds":[716620213,716620214]},{"nodeId":716620213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":410145370,"text":"どういう意味？","nextNodeIds":[716620215]},{"nodeId":716620215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2133620794,"text":"それはただの例え。正確に言うと「立幅約五十二歩、横幅約五十二歩、高さ不明」のエリアなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620216]},{"nodeId":716620216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":1296756498,"text":"五十二歩までは、石のタイルが敷かれていて、ごく普通のエリアにしか見えない。だが、五十二歩を越えたあたりから、濃霧のようなものが充満しているんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620217]},{"nodeId":716620217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":36044210,"text":"しかも、エリアから出ようと境界線を超えたやつは…","nextNodeIds":[716620218]},{"nodeId":716620218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":4136663026,"text":"なんと訳も分からずに振り向いて、反対側へ進み始めたり…突然消えて、みんなの後ろに現れたりしたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620219]},{"nodeId":716620219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":1647412586,"text":"つまり、どんな方法を使っても、五十二歩を超えた場所にはたどり着けなかった。","nextNodeIds":[716620220]},{"nodeId":716620220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3003893138,"text":"道具とかを使ってみたら？","nextNodeIds":[716620221]},{"nodeId":716620221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3573056234,"text":"もちろん試したよ。でも、何か投げても元の場所に返ってくるし、たいまつの光もその先を照らすことができなかった。","nextNodeIds":[716620222]},{"nodeId":716620222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3352140650,"text":"だから、その秘境を探索してほしいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620223]},{"nodeId":716620223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3920227394,"text":"その通り。でも…君たちに頼みたいのは、「探索」だけじゃないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[716620224]},{"nodeId":716620224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":573275874,"text":"ここで説明してもしょうがないから、とりあえず秘境に入ろう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":716620214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2336905650,"text":"空っぽの…家？","nextNodeIds":[716620215]},{"nodeId":716620206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2894546610,"text":"そ、その通りかも…","nextNodeIds":[716620207]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166202,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30153"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7166203,"order":3,"stepDescription":"秘境に入る","stepDescTextMapHash":4012528316,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2122,512],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLB